# [#](#layout) Layout

Namespace: `options.layout`, the global options for the chart layout is defined in `Chart.defaults.layout`.

| Name | Type | Default | [Scriptable](/docs/latest/general/options.html#scriptable-options) | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `autoPadding` | `boolean` | `true` | No | Apply automatic padding so visible elements are completely drawn. |
| `padding` | [`Padding`](/docs/latest/general/padding.html) | `0` | Yes | The padding to add inside the chart. |
